<title>UK: British output rebounds strongly in June.</title>
<headline>British output rebounds strongly in June.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>British manufacturing output rebounded in June and there was an unexpected surge in overall industrial production, official figures showed on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Manufacturing output rose 0.4 percent in June, in line with analysts' forecasts, after a downswing of 1.0 percent in May. June output rose 1.2 percent on the year. Overall industrial production was up 1.4 percent in June, way above market forecasts of a 0.5 percent rise.</p>
</text>
